## Interface: 16001
## Title: Riksantikvarieämbetet
## Category: THÖNDERSTÖRM
## IconTexture: Interface\Icons\INV_Misc_Shovel_01
## Notes: A report of every dungeon and raid run when you leave it: time, enemies killed, bosses, experience, gold, what the loot is worth at a vendor, the best find, and who died (and to what). Dying and running back in keeps the same run. Optionally a one-line summary in party chat. /raa shows the last report, /raa lista the latest runs.
## Version: 0.1
## OptionalDeps: Rattsmedicinalverket
## SavedVariables: RiksantikvarieambetetDB
Core.lua
